1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bc4 f5 4. d4 4... exd4 { Black takes the centre pawn. White cannot recapture at once, and the e-file is now open. } 5. e5 { White pushes past the f5 pawn. } 5... d5 { Hits the bishop and challenges the new pawn. } 6. exd6 (6. Bb5 6... Bb4+ 7. c3 7... dxc3) (6. Bb3 6... Bb4+ 7. c3 7... dxc3) 6... Qxd6 7. O-O 7... Nf6 8. Re1+ 8... Be7 9. Bg5 9... Bd7 *
